    "name": "Restful-Booker API Tests",
    "description": "This project demonstrates REST API testing using Postman and JavaScript-based test scripts. It covers authentication, health checks, and end-to-end booking CRUD operations, including Create, Read, Update, Partial Update, and Delete.\n\n**Key highlights:**\n\n- Automated response validation using Postman assertions.\n    \n- HTTP status code and JSON response validation.\n    \n- Dynamic environment variables for authentication tokens and booking IDs.\n    \n- Validation of booking data, field types, and update behavior.\n    \n- Verification of successful deletion and expected `404 Not Found` responses.\n    \n\n**Tools:** Postman, REST APIs, JavaScript, JSON, and environment variables.\n\nThis project showcases my practical skills in API testing, test scripting, and validating REST API behavior.",
